    "cat.k1.nx.2d":"Merging goods from several suppliers, up to 20 days of free storage and label stickers — all before the border.",
    "cat.k1.nx.3t":"Freight from China to Azerbaijan",
    "cat.k1.nx.3d":"Routes and transit windows — so you can count the order date back from the season.",
    "cat.k1.cta.title":"Know the regime and the number before you order",
    "cat.k1.cta.sub":"Send your item list: we check the code, the duty, the VAT and the sanitary requirement. The calculation comes within 12 hours and the price holds for 7 days.",
